
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>The Land of the Story Book</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #fff4e6;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #663399;
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #ffcc66;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #333;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        section {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .story {
            background: white;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            max-width: 600px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 8px #ccc;
        }

        .story h2 {
            color: #663399;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #663399;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>📚 The Land of the Story Book</h1>
    <p>Welcome to the Magical World of Stories!</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#stories">Stories</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
    <h2>🌈 Welcome, Little Readers!</h2>
    <p>
        Stories take us to magical worlds.
        They teach us good values and make us happy.
        Let's explore the wonderful land of story books!
    </p>
</section>

<section id="stories">
    <h2>✨ Our Favourite Stories</h2>

    <div class="story">
        <h2>🐰 The Rabbit and the Tortoise</h2>
        <p>A rabbit and a tortoise have a race.
        The slow tortoise wins because he never gives up.</p>
        <b>Moral: Slow and steady wins the race.</b>
    </div>

    <div class="story">
        <h2>🦁 The Lion and the Mouse</h2>
        <p>A little mouse helps a big lion.
        The lion learns that even small friends are important.</p>
        <b>Moral: Kindness is never wasted.</b>
    </div>

    <div class="story">
        <h2>👦 The Thirsty Crow</h2>
        <p>A thirsty crow finds a pot with little water.
        It drops stones into the pot and drinks the water.</p>
        <b>Moral: Where there is a will, there is a way.</b>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
    <h2>📖 About Our Website</h2>
    <p>
        This website is created as a school project.
        It helps children enjoy reading stories and learn
        important moral values.
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>Thank You for Visiting Our Story Book Land! ❤️</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
